155
00:11:19,500 --> 00:11:24,360
First of all, some of you may have heard we just did an event on Tuesday.

156
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:26,340
Ryan said I could share a little bit about it.

157
00:11:26,340 --> 00:11:28,680
I called it the mystery bus trip.

158
00:11:28,680 --> 00:11:31,940
And when I was in college, we did something like this.

159
00:11:31,940 --> 00:11:38,360
We took our third, fourth, and fifth graders on a massive party bus.

160
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:42,720
If you know Dave Spence, he's not here this morning, so I can't fully embarrass him.

161
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:45,020
But this trip would not have happened without him.

162
00:11:45,140 --> 00:11:51,840
He rented this party bus, which was not cheap.

163
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:54,380
But I couldn't find a bus to take us anywhere.

164
00:11:54,380 --> 00:11:58,660
And so somebody told me to check with him, and this is what he got us.

165
00:11:59,380 --> 00:12:03,400
So this, and had surrounded, I mean, it was incredible.

166
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:06,200
So if you know Dave Spence, tell him thank you.

167
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:12,000
So background, the reason I wanted to do this trip, the reason I'm sharing with you is,

168
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:16,300
I know sometimes the things that kids do here, you're like, is that even church?

169
00:12:16,300 --> 00:12:17,220
What in the world?

170
00:12:17,780 --> 00:12:22,400
So we have kids that have been coming here for months and even years that sit alone.

171
00:12:22,400 --> 00:12:24,340
They haven't connected with anybody.

172
00:12:24,340 --> 00:12:28,600
And it breaks my heart to see them come and not have a friend.

173
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:31,260
We have other kids that are just in this group, and they love it.

174
00:12:31,260 --> 00:12:38,260
But my heart in this trip was to take the kids away from the hour and 15 minutes that we get on Sunday

175
00:12:38,260 --> 00:12:40,540
and really push friendship.

176
00:12:40,540 --> 00:12:43,400
And, man, all the prayers came true.

177
00:12:43,560 --> 00:12:48,080
They made more friends, the kids that sat alone made friends,

178
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:50,440
and I see them in there this morning with their friends.

179
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:51,560
It's changed everything.

180
00:12:51,560 --> 00:12:52,660
So I want to share with you a little bit.

181
00:12:52,660 --> 00:12:56,540
Our first stop, you have the playground, any of the playground ones?

182
00:12:56,540 --> 00:12:59,020
Second stop.

183
00:12:59,020 --> 00:13:00,120
