184
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:01,520
This was our second stop.

185
00:13:01,520 --> 00:13:04,000
We went to the Franklin Park Pool.

186
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:08,320
So they had no idea where we were going until we pulled up, which was really fun.

187
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:11,340
And so this was the second stop at the Franklin Park Pool.

188
00:13:11,680 --> 00:13:15,180
The first stop was at Chet Hobart Park in Berryville.

189
00:13:15,180 --> 00:13:18,440
That was where we did team-building activities.

190
00:13:18,440 --> 00:13:22,400
That's where they really – this is the second stop – or first stop.

191
00:13:22,400 --> 00:13:26,480
