192
00:13:26,480 --> 00:13:27,460
It was at Urban Air.

193
00:13:27,460 --> 00:13:28,620
Have you guys ever heard of Urban Air?

194
00:13:28,620 --> 00:13:33,640
So Urban Air is in Frederick, Maryland, and this is Urban Air.

195
00:13:33,640 --> 00:13:35,180
They have trampolines.

196
00:13:35,180 --> 00:13:38,180
They have upside-down bumper cars.

197
00:13:38,180 --> 00:13:41,360
They have that – jousting.

198
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:41,760
Thank you.

199
00:13:41,760 --> 00:13:42,340
Jousting.

200
00:13:42,340 --> 00:13:46,160
They have zip lines that, like, you fly across.

201
00:13:46,160 --> 00:13:49,360
So as you can imagine, this was really good for friendship building.

202
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:51,140
There's a zip line.

203
00:13:51,140 --> 00:13:51,980
I think that's Brody.

204
00:13:53,280 --> 00:13:57,140
So anyway, I just wanted to share with you – those are the upside-down bumper cars.

205
00:13:57,140 --> 00:13:57,940
They were so much fun.

206
00:13:57,940 --> 00:14:03,780
I just wanted to share with you, thank you for allowing me to do these crazy things that I do

207
00:14:03,780 --> 00:14:08,680
because I promise you lives are being changed and kids are inviting friends to church

208
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:10,640
