209
00:14:10,780 --> 00:14:16,120
And then they get to hear all about Jesus and how much he loves them, which brings me to my second thing.

210
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:20,100
Ryan saw this idea and shared it with me, and I loved it.

211
00:14:20,100 --> 00:14:24,240
And so I made 99 bookmarks.

212
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:32,160
Every single bookmark has the name of a child that is either going into kindergarten up to going into fifth.

213
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:37,760
Next week, Donovan is going to bring bookmarks for those middle schoolers and high schoolers and even college students.

214
00:14:37,760 --> 00:14:40,420
It has their first name and their age.

215
00:14:40,780 --> 00:14:45,720
The purpose of this is I'm asking you to take one bookmark.

216
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:51,980
They are on the welcome desk as you leave and pray for this child for the entire school year.

217
00:14:51,980 --> 00:15:00,740
One thing that has been really hard for me as my kids get older is the realization that my relationship with Jesus

218
00:15:00,740 --> 00:15:02,380
is not their relationship with Jesus.

219
00:15:02,380 --> 00:15:09,160
So my 10-year-old son has a lot of fears, and he has a lot of questions and doubts.

220
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:14,540
I've learned personally that doubts about Jesus are actually a really, really good thing.

221
00:15:14,540 --> 00:15:20,360
Because every single time I've had doubts about Jesus, I research what it is that I'm doubting,

222
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:25,800
and it brings me closer to him because I find the answers, and then I have that within me.

223
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:31,400
When a doubt creeps up, I have that answer that, no, I don't have to fear that anymore because God already answered in this.

224
00:15:31,520 --> 00:15:33,420
So his doubts don't scare me.

225
00:15:33,420 --> 00:15:34,700
I love researching it with him.

226
00:15:34,700 --> 00:15:39,280
But as soon as you answer a question, another one comes, another doubt comes, another fear comes.

227
00:15:39,280 --> 00:15:45,620
And God clearly spoke to me the other night and said, your relationship with me is not his.

228
00:15:45,620 --> 00:15:48,600
He hasn't experienced me like you have.

229
00:15:48,980 --> 00:15:51,580
And as a mom, that's hard.

230
00:15:51,580 --> 00:15:54,540
I want him to be completely in love with Jesus and to trust him.

231
00:15:54,540 --> 00:16:02,460
But it's taken so many things and so many years and so many situations and experiences to get me to that point with Jesus.

232
00:16:03,260 --> 00:16:10,320
And so we have a prayer that really spoke to me about this.

233
00:16:10,320 --> 00:16:15,920
Rather than praying that they have an easy school year and a nice teacher and they make friends,

234
00:16:15,920 --> 00:16:23,420
we pray that they lean on Jesus in every situation because bad situations are coming.

235
00:16:23,420 --> 00:16:25,140
Hard times are coming.

236
00:16:25,140 --> 00:16:26,980
